    "behavioral_diff": "v0.5.0 adds three production-hardening capabilities: (1) per-entry encryption — entries with IsSecret=true are encrypted at rest via IConfigEncryptor (default: ASP.NET Core Data Protection); consumers can plug in custom encryptors by registering IConfigEncryptor before AddDbConfig; (2) audit log — every Upsert/Delete on EfCoreConfigStore writes a DbConfig_AuditEntries row atomically in the same transaction; the HTTP endpoint GET /{app}/{env}/audit/{*key} and UI History dialog surface this log; (3) scope column collation hardening — Scope/Environment/Key columns on both tables now use case-sensitive binary collations on both SQL Server and PostgreSQL, closing the mismatch between C# ordinal scopeFilter comparisons and DB query semantics. Additionally, two cleanup items landed: ScopeSelector setTimeout hack removed, and SpinWait test patterns replaced with deterministic synchronization."
